    "body": "<!-- pr-reviewer: 6eefa297677963790623026a7293ccd29a555e56 -->\n**Review (M3, docs): ready for the maintainer to merge.**\n- The new Importing, Turning and Plasma sections each give a Means and a Fix, with headings copied from the code. Examples: `generate.rs:2183` \"needs a turning insert\", `lathe_voice.rs:93`, `model_fidelity.rs:42` `TOO_COARSE`, the IGES refusal in `commands/mod.rs:135`.\n- The new `docs_troubleshooting` test fails if a quoted message is reworded in the source, so the page can't silently go stale.\n- **Local results** (trial-merged with main, clean):\n  - `zola build`: 41 pages.\n  - `zola check --skip-external-links`: clean.\n  - `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test docs_troubleshooting`: 1 passed.\n",
